# REQUIRED for the Jitsi video-call screen to work.
#
# When this flag is unset, Expo CLI's Metro resolver
# (@expo/cli/.../withMetroMultiPlatform.js) redirects EVERY import of
# `@react-navigation/core` -- including those made from inside node_modules --
# to `expo-router/react-navigation`, i.e. expo-router's vendored React
# Navigation v7 core. `@jitsi/react-native-sdk` uses React Navigation v6 and
# marks its nested NavigationContainers with the v6 `independent={true}` prop,
# which the v7 core ignores. The result is the runtime error
# "Looks like you have nested a 'NavigationContainer' inside another" as soon
# as Jitsi mounts its conference/lobby navigators.
#
# Setting the flag disables that redirect, so Jitsi runs on the real v6 core
# it was built for, fully separate from expo-router's navigation tree.
# See .kiro/specs/fix-meeting-join-crash/.
EXPO_ROUTER_DISABLE_RN_NAVIGATION_CHECK=1
